{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Alt_ergo_common.Solving_loop</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"alt-ergo","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Alt_ergo_common","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Solving_loop","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec exception anchored\" id=\"exception-Exit_with_code\"><a href=\"#exception-Exit_with_code\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">exception</span> </span><span><span class=\"exception\">Exit_with_code</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Exception raised to notify that <code>process_source</code> cannot continue. The integer corresponds to an error code.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-limits\"><a href=\"#type-limits\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> limits</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-limits.reproducible_resource_limit\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-limits.reproducible_resource_limit\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>reproducible_resource_limit : int;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-parse_result\"><a href=\"#type-parse_result\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> parse_result</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-parse_result.path\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-parse_result.path\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>path : <span>[ `Stdin <span><span>| `File</span> of string</span> ]</span>;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Path to the input file.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-parse_result.limits\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-parse_result.limits\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>limits : <a href=\"#type-limits\">limits</a>;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-main\"><a href=\"#val-main\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> main : <span><a href=\"#type-parse_result\">parse_result</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>main path</code> solves the input problem <code>path</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-process_source\"><a href=\"#val-process_source\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> process_source : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?selector_inst</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../../alt-ergo-lib/AltErgoLib/Expr/index.html#type-t\">AltErgoLib.Expr.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">print_status</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../../alt-ergo-lib/AltErgoLib/Frontend/index.html#type-status\">AltErgoLib.Frontend.status</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?limits</span>:<a href=\"#type-limits\">limits</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Dolmen_loop</span>.State.source <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>process_source ?selector_inst ~print_status src</code> processes the input source <code>src</code> and call <code>print_status</code> on each answers. The hook <code>selector_inst</code> allows to track generated instantiations.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <a href=\"#exception-Exit_with_code\"><code>Exit_with_code</code></a> <p>c with c &lt;&gt; 0 if a fatal error occurs. Recovarable errors raise this exception if <code>Options.get_exit_on_error ()</code> is <code>true</code>.</p></li></ul></div></div>"}